	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: [
				"Welcome to Tubumbu 42.04.4 LTS"
				"*** System restart required ***"
				"Last login: Fri May 25 1979 from 189.26.60.236"
				"bishop@romulus:~$ cat clanging_howl.jv"
				"Project Clanging Howl"
				"-------------------"
				"Following a recent meteor shower, reports of strange sounds led to a throrough search of the report's location. Though most of the search resulted in nothing but pebbles and bits of an unknown metal, one living specimen was captured and taken into custody. Weather reports indicated that a similar event may occur &levery 15 days&r."
				"Subject ch-001 is believed to be the first step into the cosmos, and how we may better understand its workings."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "0B2C4ACAE75F106F"
