			description: [
				"bishop@romulus:~$ cat ext_stl_ing.jv"
				"------------------------------"
				"Researchers managed to gather enough of the unknown metal to forge into an ingot. The heat appeared to have set off some sort of chemical reaction. Those working on the project have been recorded as feeling sick. For safety reasons, they have since been quarantined."
