		{
			dependencies: ["4E17A7CEDA5CA534"]
			description: [
				"bishop@romulus:~$ cat ext_stl_tol.jv"
				"------------------------------"
				"Researchers and forges worked to put together a complete set of tools using the unknown metal, ch-101, informally referred to as Extraterrestrial Steel. Like the weapons also forged, the metal proved effective in &lbypassing the natural resistance of technoflesh organisms&r."
				"The tools themselves prove powerful, easily matching diamond tools in strength but not in durability."
