		{
			dependencies: ["4E17A7CEDA5CA534"]
			description: [
				"bishop@romulus:~$ cat ext_stl_wpn.jv"
				"------------------------------"
				"Researchers and forges worked to put together a sword using the unknown metal, ch-101, informally referred to as Extraterrestrial Steel. The sword's irradiating effect was contained, only truly affected those it damaged. A hammer was also forged, and proved to be rather powerful."
				"In addition to its raw strength and irradiating effects, the weapons &lbypassed the natural armor of technoflesh organisms&r."
			]
